=head1 DESCRIPTION

Limits that are applicable for the given Amazon OpenSearch Service
storage type.

=head1 ATTRIBUTES


=head2 LimitName => Str

Name of storage limits that are applicable for the given storage type.
If C<StorageType> is C<ebs>, the following options are available:

=over

=item *

B<MinimumVolumeSize> - Minimum volume size that is available for the
given storage type. Can be empty if not applicable.

=item *

B<MaximumVolumeSize> - Maximum volume size that is available for the
given storage type. Can be empty if not applicable.

=item *

B<MaximumIops> - Maximum amount of IOPS that is available for the given
the storage type. Can be empty if not applicable.

=item *

B<MinimumIops> - Minimum amount of IOPS that is available for the given
the storage type. Can be empty if not applicable.

=item *

B<MaximumThroughput> - Maximum amount of throughput that is available
for the given the storage type. Can be empty if not applicable.

=item *

